                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="553 1952 553 1963 1301 1973 1303 1973 1414 1961 1555 1971 1557 1971 1559 1971 1599 1961 1775 1961 1806 1971 1808 1971 1810 1971 2211 1961 2213 1948 2210 1918 1944 1907 1943 1907 1941 1907 1939 1907 1925 1918 1777 1918 1714 1907 1713 1907 1711 1907 1709 1907 1695 1918 1594 1918 1551 1907 1549 1907 1547 1907 1545 1907 1512 1916 1455 1907 1453 1907 1329 1918 1266 1909 1264 1909 1262 1909 1223 1918 1089 1909 1087 1909 1015 1918 982 1909 980 1909 978 1909 869 1918 771 1909 769 1909 699 1918 668 1909 666 1909 664 1909 662 1909 623 1918 578 1909 576 1909 574 1909 551 1918 553 1952"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Another “idle-wanderer,” Yaqaˊq, was already an old man. His life was"/>
                    </TextLine>

